node-telegram-send-title = Send message
node-telegram-send-description = Send text, media or composed message to Telegram
node-telegram-send-help = Connect In and Chat. Message takes plain text (type it right on the node or connect Text from template), a message from Compose message (text + media + keyboard), or media directly. Leave the Chat property empty to use its input. Reply to keeps the original topic when known; Topic overrides it. Done and Message are emitted on success; Failed and Error on failure.
