node-telegram-edit-description = Replace a Telegram message's text or keyboard
node-telegram-edit-help = Connect In, Chat, Message id and Message. Message takes plain text (type it right on the node or connect Text from template) or a message from Compose message with text and an optional inline keyboard. Editing media or using reply keyboards is not supported. Keep buttons controls whether existing buttons remain when the message has no keyboard. Done means the edit succeeded; Failed and Error describe a failure.
