node-telegram-button-description = Build a Telegram keyboard button
node-telegram-button-help = Creates a button for the Keyboard node. Text is required for the button label. Select an action: Callback (for inline keyboards, sends callback data or the button text if Data is empty), URL (for inline keyboards, opens a web link from Data), Text (for reply keyboards, sends text), or Share contact / Share location (for reply keyboards). Connect Button to a Keyboard input.
